[DB] SQLite 数据库已就绪: /www/wwwroot/buyuan-company-website/buqin_mall_package/buqin.db
[DB] 商品表字段迁移完成
[DB] 商品图片表 & 导入日志表 & 批量图片导入表已就绪
========================================
  埠勤商贸 API 服务器 v2.0
  http://localhost:3001
  MariaDB 数据源
  - GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/tables/:name
  - GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/products
  - POST /api/products/import-jd (京东链接导入)
  - POST /api/products/preview-jd (京东链接预览)
  - GET  /api/products/:id/images (商品图片查询)
  - POST /api/products/:id/images/upload (手动上传图片)
  - POST /api/products/:id/images/download (下载京东图片)
  - POST /api/products/:id/images/reorder (拖拽排序)
  - PUT/DELETE /api/products/images/:imageId (图片操作)
  - GET  /api/proxy-image?url=... (图片代理，解决防盗链)
  - POST /api/images/batch-download (批量下载图片到本地)
  - POST /api/images/batch-import-by-barcode (按编号批量导入图片)
  - POST /api/products/import-excel-v2 (Excel导入含内嵌图片)
  - POST /api/hunyuan/chat
  - POST /api/hunyuan/ocr
